  "keyFeatures": [
    "Multi-tenant architecture: each school operates in full isolation",
    "Dual attendance tracking: campus-level (Plantel) and classroom-level with cross-validation",
    "Three attendance recording methods: facial recognition, QR code bracelet, and manual roll call",
    "Optional biometric integration via an independent Python/FastAPI microservice",
    "Role-based access control powered by Spatie Permissions with per-tenant role cloning",
    "Academic management: students, teachers, sections, subjects, and enrollment wizard",
    "WhatsApp alerts for absences and tardiness via Evolution API",
    "Chatwoot SSO integration for an internal messaging center",
    "Excel/PDF import and export for student data, grades, and attendance reports",
    "Laravel Pulse observability dashboard and OPcodes Log Viewer",
    "Progressive onboarding wizard for new schools (Owner and self-registration flows)",
    "Demo data seeder command (orvian:seed-demo) for evaluation environments",
    "Offline-ready architecture with sync columns prepared for future edge-node deployment"
  ],
